# mod-custom-spells: the Priest spells of the concept revision of 2026-10-08
# (share-public custom-spells/09-concept-revision-20261008.md) on a bot - the
# changed 900900 / 900966 (Paragon damage) and 900933 (Holy Fire Heals) and the
# new 900904-900906, 900935-900943, 900969-900975. Every check states the
# revised line, so a FAIL marks a defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018: take 0 damage, never die, the combat log still reads the full
# amount; a dummy stays in combat 5 s after its last direct hit) on a 4-yd
# circle around (-270, 150). Slot 4 belongs to the cs_* scenarios; the cleanup
# unlearns every custom spell again. TBOT04's Paragon level is 1 (2026-10-08):
# "666 + 5 x Paragon level" = 671.
# Spells: Power Word: Shield 48066 (Weakened Soul 6788), Flash Heal 48071,
# Shadow Word: Pain 48125, Smite 48123, Holy Fire 48135, Holy Nova 48078 (heal
# 48076), Mind Blast 48127, Lightwell 48087 (NPC 31883, charges 59907, renew
# 48085), Spirit of Redemption (talent 20711 -> spirit form 27827, 15 s),
# Shadowform 15473, Emberseer Bonus Damage 16534 (2000 physical to the caster),
# Full Heal 25840, Young Black Bear 1128 (hostile), Diseased Young Wolf 299
# (level 1, to kill).
name    Custom spells - Priest revision 2026-10-08
timeout 360s

bot pr priest slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require pr alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near pr
require d1 exists
do gm target pr
as gm .unlearn 900900
as gm .unlearn 900901
as gm .unlearn 900902
as gm .unlearn 900904
as gm .unlearn 900905
as gm .unlearn 900906
as gm .unlearn 900933
as gm .unlearn 900935
as gm .unlearn 900936
as gm .unlearn 900937
as gm .unlearn 900938
as gm .unlearn 900941
as gm .unlearn 900942
as gm .unlearn 900966
as gm .unlearn 900967
as gm .unlearn 900969
as gm .unlearn 900970
as gm .unlearn 900971
as gm .unlearn 900972
as gm .unlearn 900975
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
as gm .unlearn 20711
as gm .unaura 48066
as gm .unaura 6788
as gm .unaura 15473
as gm .unaura 900940
as gm .unaura 900943
as gm .unaura 900973
do pr learn 48066
do pr learn 48071
do pr learn 48125
do pr learn 48123
do pr learn 48135
do pr learn 48078
do pr learn 48127
do pr learn 48087
do pr goto -263 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick de creature:920018 near pr
do pr goto -270 157 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick dn creature:920018 near pr
do pr goto -270 143 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick ds creature:920018 near pr
do pr goto -264 155 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick dne creature:920018 near pr
do pr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr approach d1
wait 500ms

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shadow (eruption)
log Shadow - 900966 Shadow Eruption, its helper row: 900968 deals 666 Shadow without a die and cannot miss - aimed at d1 it hits all 8 dummies for 5,328 (crits add 333; the old row's 801-1,000 a hit came to at least 6,408)
spelllog start
do pr cast 900968 at d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 900968 hits == 8
expect pr spell 900968 damage >= 5328
expect pr spell 900968 damage <= 6327

log Shadow - 900966 CONCEPT "dmg dependent on paragon lvl": a DoT tick's eruption (20 %, 2 s ICD) hits the 7 other dummies for 666 + 5 x Paragon level each - the window closes on the first eruption: 7 hits, 4,662-5,600 (Paragon 1-18, crits included; 801-1,000 a hit would be 5,607 or more)
do pr learn 900966
do pr goto -293 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr reset
spelllog start
do pr cast 48125 on d1
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48125 on dn
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48125 on ds
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48125 on de
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48125 on dne
waitfor pr spell 900968 casts >= 1 timeout 40s
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 900968 casts == 1
expect pr spell 900968 hits == 7
expect pr spell 900968 damage >= 4662
expect pr spell 900968 damage <= 5600
as gm .unlearn 900966

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Discipline
log Discipline - 900900 CONCEPT "shields explode on breaking/fading (dmg depended on paragon lvl)": a broken Power Word: Shield explodes (900903) for 666 + 5 x Paragon level Holy on every enemy within 10 yd of the shielded unit - the priest in the ring's middle, two 2000-damage hits (16534) break it: 8 hits, 5,328-6,400 (the old explosion dealt the absorption, over 17,000 on eight dummies)
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr learn 900900
do pr reset
as gm .unaura 6788
# reset clears cooldowns, not the global cooldown of the cast before (result 67 in run 490)
wait 1600ms
do pr cast 48066 on pr
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do pr cast 16534 on pr
do pr cast 16534 on pr
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect pr noaura 48066
expect pr spell 900903 hits == 8
expect pr spell 900903 damage >= 5328
expect pr spell 900903 damage <= 6400
as gm .unlearn 900900
as gm .unaura 6788
do pr reset

log Discipline - 900905 Smite +9 targets (jump targets 0 -> 10), 900906 Smite +50 %
do pr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr approach d1
do pr learn 900905
do pr learn 900906
expect pr spellmod 48123 damage 100 == 150
expect pr spellmod 48123 jumptargets 0 == 10
spelllog start
do pr cast 48123 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 48123 maxtargets >= 8

log Discipline - 900904 CONCEPT "heals the lowest % health ally in 30y range by 10% of your damage": the director down 4000 health, the priest at full - three Smites (+9 targets) on the ring heal the director (900904, effective healing) and nobody else
do pr learn 900904
do pr reset
do gm target gm
as gm .damage 4000
do gm target pr
spelllog start
do pr cast 48123 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
do pr cast 48123 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
do pr cast 48123 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 900904 heal >= 300
expect pr spell 900904 targets == 1
do gm cast 25840 on gm triggered
as gm .unlearn 900904
as gm .unlearn 900905
as gm .unlearn 900906

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Holy
log Holy - 900933 CONCEPT "your direct heals have a chance of 50% to cast holy fire on a random enemy in a 30y radius of the target": 12 Flash Heals on the priest 18 yd west of the ring's middle (no dummy within 14 yd), the dummies kept in combat by a Holy Nova (48078, triggered) from the middle before every second heal; each proc is Holy Fire (900934) on ONE enemy - statistical (6 expected, at least 2)
do pr learn 900933
do pr reset
spelllog start
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr goto -288 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr goto -288 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr goto -288 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr reset
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr goto -288 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr goto -288 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr goto -288 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
do pr cast 48071 on pr
wait 1700ms
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 48071 casts >= 10
expect pr spell 900934 casts >= 2
expect pr spell 900934 maxtargets == 1
as gm .unlearn 900933
do pr reset

log Holy - 900935 Holy Fire +9 targets (0 -> 10), 900936 Holy Fire +50 % (the direct damage and the DoT)
do pr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr approach d1
do pr learn 900935
do pr learn 900936
expect pr spellmod 48135 damage 100 == 150
expect pr spellmod 48135 dot 100 == 150
expect pr spellmod 48135 jumptargets 0 == 10
spelllog start
do pr cast 48135 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 48135 maxtargets >= 8
as gm .unlearn 900935
as gm .unlearn 900936

log Holy - 900941 CONCEPT "holy nova radius +50%" (10 -> 15 yd, the damage and the heal): from 14 yd west of the ring's middle Holy Nova reaches at most three dummies without it and five or more with it
do pr goto -284 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
spelllog start
do pr cast 48078 triggered
wait 800ms
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 48078 maxtargets <= 3
do pr learn 900941
expect pr spellmod 48078 radius 10 == 15
expect pr spellmod 48076 radius 10 == 15
spelllog start
do pr cast 48078 triggered
wait 800ms
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 48078 maxtargets >= 5
as gm .unlearn 900941

log Holy - 900942 CONCEPT "casting holy nova increases the damage of your next holy fire by 50% (stacks 10 times)": three Holy Novas -> 3 stacks of Kindled Fire (900943: Holy Fire +150 %); the next Holy Fire takes them all
do pr learn 900942
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48078 triggered
do pr cast 48078 triggered
wait 300ms
expect pr aurastacks 900943 == 3
expect pr spellmod 48135 damage 100 == 250
do pr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr approach d1
wait 300ms
do pr cast 48135 on d1 triggered
wait 500ms
expect pr noaura 900943
as gm .unlearn 900942

log Holy - control: a Lightwell (48087 rank 6: NPC 31883, 10 charges) gives nobody a renew by itself
do pr reset
as gm .damage 3000
do pr cast 48087 at -283 150 -423.2 triggered
wait 1s
pick lw creature:31883 near pr
require lw exists
expect lw auracharges 59907 == 10
wait 2500ms
expect pr noaura 48085

log Holy - 900937 CONCEPT "your well of light auto heals allies players around it": with it the Lightwell renews (48085) the priest - below 90 % health within 20 yd - by itself and spends a charge
do pr learn 900937
waitfor pr aura 48085 timeout 3s
expect lw auracharges 59907 == 9
as gm .unlearn 900937
do gm target lw
as gm .npc delete
do gm target pr
do pr reset

log Holy - 900938 CONCEPT "on death, summon a guardian that keeps mobs in combat. in your spirit of redemption form, you get +50% haste +50% damage and healing. its duration is extended by 10 seconds. [then] you are rezzed and the summon npc despawns (5min cd)" (needs the talent 20711): a Young Black Bear fights the priest; the priest dies -> Spirit of Redemption for 25 s with Empowered Redemption (900939) and the cooldown (900940), the Redemption Guardian (900964) holds the bear; then the priest lives with half his health, the guardian is gone and the bear turns back to him
do pr learn 20711
do pr learn 900938
do pr goto -290 165 -423.2
do gm gm on
do gm goto -290 165 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 1128
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
pick bear creature:1128 near pr
require bear exists
waitfor bear victim pr timeout 5s
do pr die
wait 500ms
expect pr alive
expect pr aura 27827
expect pr auraduration 27827 > 20000
expect pr aura 900939
expect pr aura 900940
pick gd creature:900964 near pr
require gd exists
waitfor bear victim gd timeout 3s
expect bear incombat
wait 26s
expect pr alive
expect pr noaura 27827
expect pr noaura 900939
expect pr health >= 45%
expect pr minions 900964 == 0
expect bear alive
waitfor bear victim pr timeout 3s
do pr cast 48078 triggered
wait 1500ms
expect creature:1128 missing

log Holy - 900938 its 5-min cooldown (900940, kept through death): a second death within it is the core's own Spirit of Redemption - 15 s, no guardian, then death
do pr die
wait 500ms
expect pr aura 27827
expect pr auramaxduration 27827 <= 15000
expect pr minions 900964 == 0
wait 16s
expect pr dead
do pr revive
waitfor pr alive timeout 3s
as gm .unaura 900940
as gm .unlearn 900938
as gm .unlearn 20711
do gm gm off
do pr reset

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shadow
log Shadow - 900969 Shadow Word: Pain +50 % (a pure DoT: the periodic modifier), 900970 Mind Blast +50 %, 900971 Mind Blast +9 targets (0 -> 10)
do pr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr approach d1
do pr learn 900969
do pr learn 900970
do pr learn 900971
expect pr spellmod 48125 dot 100 == 150
expect pr spellmod 48127 damage 100 == 150
expect pr spellmod 48127 jumptargets 0 == 10
spelllog start
do pr cast 48127 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 48127 maxtargets >= 8

log Shadow - 900972 CONCEPT "killing an enemy in shadow form ... increases your shadow damage by 1% (100 stacks)" and 900975 "killing an enemy while in shadowform spawns a lesser tentacle on its position (doesnt move, hits small-medium)": in Shadowform a Mind Blast (+9 targets) kills a level-1 wolf in the ring's middle -> one stack of Soul Feast (900973) and a Lesser Tentacle (900999) there for 15 s that lashes (900976) the dummies the Mind Blasts keep in combat, without moving
do pr cast 15473 triggered
wait 300ms
expect pr aura 15473
do pr learn 900972
do pr learn 900975
do gm goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 300ms
as gm .npc add temp 299
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
pick wolf creature:299 near gm
require wolf exists
do pr approach wolf 9
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do pr cast 48127 on wolf triggered
wait 500ms
expect pr aurastacks 900973 == 1
expect pr minions 900999 == 1
pick tn creature:900999 near pr
require tn exists
track tn
mark t0
do pr cast 48127 on d1 triggered
wait 3s
do pr cast 48127 on d1 triggered
wait 3s
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 900976 casts >= 2
expect pr spell 900976 hits >= 1
expect tn at t0 1
wait 10s
expect pr minions 900999 == 0

log Shadow - 900972 CONCEPT at 100 stacks: every 5 s a free Mind Flay (900974) on a random enemy in combat within 30 yd - an aura on the enemy, no channel: the priest's own Mind Blast (1.5-s cast) goes on meanwhile (6 Mind Blasts complete)
as gm .aura stack 900973 99
expect pr aurastacks 900973 == 100
do pr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do pr approach d1
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do pr cast 48127 on d1 triggered
wait 2500ms
do pr cast 48127 on d1 triggered
do pr cast 48127 on d1
wait 2500ms
do pr cast 48127 on d1 triggered
wait 2500ms
do pr cast 48127 on d1 triggered
wait 2500ms
do pr cast 48127 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect pr spell 900974 casts >= 1
expect pr spell 900974 ticks >= 1
expect pr spell 48127 casts >= 6
as gm .unlearn 900972
as gm .unlearn 900975

